OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage railway boss hits out at
OL,4,Adiesel hikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising diesel prices are adding to the
OL,7,Ffinancial pressures facing the Severn
OL,8,FValley Railway, with its managing
OL,9,Fdirector describing the increase as
OL,10,F"very unwelcome".
OL,12,FThe heritage attraction, which runs
OL,13,Fservices between Shropshire and
OL,14,FWorcestershire, uses diesel locomotives
OL,15,Ffor about a quarter of its trains.
OL,17,FManaging director, Gus Dunster, said a
OL,18,F35% rise in the cost of industrial
OL,19,Fdiesel was "significant", creating
OL,20,Fanother challenge for a business
OL,21,Falready facing rising operating costs.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
